cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its archived data, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Reproduction package: comparative bioinformatic analysis of human and swine MHC sequences"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/olpmi/sla-hla-publication"
url: "https://github.com/olpmi/sla-hla-publication"
date-released: "2026-09-19"
# No archive DOI has been issued; see PROVENANCE.md. Add an `identifiers:` block
# with the DOI once one exists.
abstract: >-
  Code, archived scientific inputs and documentation reproducing the figures,
  tables and statistics of a comparative analysis of human HLA and swine SLA MHC
  protein sequences, their protein-language-model projection, eplet-associated
  position agreement, and structural comparison.
keywords:
  - major histocompatibility complex
  - swine leukocyte antigen
  - human leukocyte antigen
  - xenotransplantation
  - protein language model
  - eplet
# `LICENSE` assigns copyright to the authors of the accompanying manuscript, so
# software authorship follows the manuscript author list and order.
